TITLE:: PatternStructure
SUMMARY:: A tree describing how a pattern is drawn in the Arranger.
CATEGORIES:: Streams-Patterns-Events
RELATED:: Classes/Pattern, Classes/SeqPat, Classes/Sequencer

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::PatternStructure:: walks a live LINK::Classes/Pattern::. It does not read source text. LINK::Classes/Ppar:: and LINK::Classes/Ptpar:: are vertical. LINK::Classes/Pchain:: is vertical. Every other LINK::Classes/ListPattern:: is horizontal. A LINK::Classes/FilterPattern:: has one child. A LINK::Classes/Pbind:: is a leaf, and its keys are not opened. A LINK::Classes/SeqPat:: that names a MIDI sequence, or a missing id, is a leaf labeled with that id. A LINK::Classes/SeqPat:: that names a composition expands that composition unless the id is already on the walk path. A repeat count other than 1 is kept when it is a number, including CODE::inf::. A pattern-valued repeat count is omitted.

The direction is CODE::\leaf::, CODE::\horizontal::, CODE::\vertical::, or CODE::\single::.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: from
Walks CODE::pattern::. When CODE::rootId:: is given, that id starts on the walk path, so a composition that names itself becomes a leaf.

ARGUMENT:: pattern
The object to walk. A non-pattern becomes a leaf labeled with a short CODE::asString::.

ARGUMENT:: sequencer
The LINK::Classes/Sequencer:: used to resolve a LINK::Classes/SeqPat::.

ARGUMENT:: rootId
A LINK::Classes/Symbol:: already on the walk path, or CODE::nil::.

RETURNS::
A TELETYPE::PatternStructure::.

METHOD:: new
Creates one node.

ARGUMENT:: direction
CODE::\leaf::, CODE::\horizontal::, CODE::\vertical::, or CODE::\single::.

ARGUMENT:: label
The text drawn on the chip.

ARGUMENT:: children
An LINK::Classes/Array:: of TELETYPE::PatternStructure:: nodes.

ARGUMENT:: repeats
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::, including CODE::inf::, or CODE::nil::.

ARGUMENT:: sequenceId
The named sequence this node selects, or CODE::nil:: for an anonymous pattern.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::PatternStructure::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: children
The child nodes. A leaf has an empty array.

RETURNS::
An LINK::Classes/Array:: of TELETYPE::PatternStructure::.

METHOD:: direction
CODE::\leaf::, CODE::\horizontal::, CODE::\vertical::, or CODE::\single::.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Symbol::.

METHOD:: label
The chip text before a repeat count is appended.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/String::.

METHOD:: repeats
The repeat count to draw, or CODE::nil:: when the pattern repeats once or the count is not a number.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber:: or CODE::nil::.

METHOD:: sequenceId
The named sequence this node refers to, or CODE::nil::.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Symbol:: or CODE::nil::.

PRIVATE:: init, prClassLabel, prContainer, prFrom, prLiteralLabel, prRepeats
